## BEAM flags for the release (see README, *Frugality*). The machine has one
## shared vCPU, so one scheduler is enough, and busy-waiting would only burn CPU
## credits while nothing happens.

## One scheduler, one dirty CPU scheduler, two dirty IO schedulers.
+S 1:1
+SDcpu 1:1
+SDio 2

## No busy-waiting when a scheduler runs out of work.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
